cle:<supplementary-material content-type=\"local-data\" id=\"mmc1\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"><caption><title>mmc1</title></caption><media xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"mmc1.docx\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"/></supplementary-material></p></sec><ack id=\"ack0010\"><title>Acknowledgments</title><p>This work was supported by the <funding-source id=\"gs1\">Rural Development Administration, Republic of Korea</funding-source> [Next-Generation Bio-Green 21 Program (PJ01344401)].</p></ack><fn-group><fn id=\"appsec2\" fn-type=\"supplementary-material\"><label>Appendix A</label><p id=\"p0195\">Supplementary data related to this article can be found at <ext-link xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" ext-link-type=\"doi\" xlink:href=\"10.1016/j.jgr.2018.02.005\" id=\"intref0025\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jgr.2018.02.005</ext-link>.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article></pmc-articleset>", "source": "PMC:PMC6437448", "error": ""}
