038/ncomms14153 (2017).</p><p><bold>Publisher's note:</bold> Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations.</p></sec><sec sec-type=\"supplementary-material\" id=\"S1\"><title>Supplementary Material</title><supplementary-material id=\"d32e18\" content-type=\"local-data\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"><caption><title>Supplementary Information</title><p>Supplementary Figures 1-4, Supplementary Tables 1-6, Supplementary Methods and Supplementary References</p></caption><media xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"ncomms14153-s1.pdf\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"/></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id=\"d32e24\" content-type=\"local-data\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"><caption><title>Supplementary Data 1</title><p><italic toggle=\"yes\">CYP716</italic> sequences used in the phylogenetic analysis of the <italic toggle=\"yes\">CYP716</italic> family sorted by subgroup. The columns indicate candidate name, resource, identifier, plant order, plant clade and identity to CYP716A12. Abbreviations: P450 HP, P450 homepage; PMS, PhytoMetaSyn website; CGP, The Compositae Genome Project website; L monilophytes, Leptosporangiate monilophytes; E monilophytes, Eusporangiate monilophytes.</p></caption><media xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"ncomms14153-s2.xlsx\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"/></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id=\"d32e35\" content-type=\"local-data\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"><caption><title>Peer Review File</title></caption><media xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"ncomms14153-s3.pdf\" position=\"float\" orientation=\"portrait\"/></supplementary-material></sec></body><back><ack><p>We thank Annick Bleys for help with preparing the article. This work was supported by the European Union Seventh Framework Program FP7/2007-2013 under