\"><surname>Nørholm</surname><given-names>MHH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A mutant Pfu DNA polymerase designed for advanced uracil-excision DNA engineering</article-title><source>BMC Biotechnol.</source><year>2010</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>21</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">20233396</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1186/1472-6750-10-21</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC2847956</pub-id></element-citation><mixed-citation id=\"mc-CR61\" publication-type=\"journal\">Nørholm, M. H. H. A mutant Pfu DNA polymerase designed for advanced uracil-excision DNA engineering. <italic toggle=\"yes\">BMC Biotechnol.</italic><bold>10</bold>, 21 (2010).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">20233396</pub-id>\n<pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1186/1472-6750-10-21</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC2847956</pub-id></mixed-citation></citation-alternatives></ref><ref id=\"CR62\"><label>62.</label><citation-alternatives><element-citation id=\"ec-CR62\" publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Gietz</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Schiestl</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High-efficiency yeast transformation using the LiAc/SS carrier DNA/PEG method</article-title><source>Nat. Protoc.</source><year>2007</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">17401334</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1038/nprot.2007.13</pub-id></element-citation><mixed-citation id=\"mc-CR62\" publication-type=\"journal\">Gietz, R. D. &amp; Schiestl, R. H. High-efficiency yeast transformation using the LiAc/SS carrier DNA/PEG method. <italic toggle=\"yes\">Nat. Protoc.</italic><bold>2</bold>, 31–34 (2007).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">17401334</pub-id>\n<pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1038/nprot.2007.13</pub-id></mixed-citation></citation-alternatives></ref><ref id=\"CR63\"><label>63.</label><citation-alternatives><element-citation id=\"ec-CR63\" publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Pluskal</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Castillo</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Villar-Briones</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Oresic</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>MZmine 2: modular framework for processing, visualizing, and analyzing mass spectrometry-based molecular profile data</article-title><source>BMC Bioinforma.</source><year>2010</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>395</fpage><lpage>395</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1186/1471-2105-11-395</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC2918584</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">20650010</pub-id></element-citation><mixed-citation id=\"mc-CR63\" publication-type=\"journal\">Pluskal, T., Castillo, S., Villar-Briones, A. &amp; Oresic, M. MZmine 2: modular framework for processing, visualizing, and analyzing mass spectrometry-based molecular profile data. <italic toggle=\"yes\">BMC Bioinforma.</italic><bold>11</bold>, 395–395 (2010).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1186/1471-2105-11-395</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC2918584</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">20650010</pub-id></mixed-citation></citation-alternatives></ref></ref-list></back></article></pmc-articleset>", "source": "PMC:PMC9411204", "error": ""}
