\n<surname>Lamborot</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>J. S.</given-names>\n<surname>Martín</surname></string-name></person-group>, <article-title>1,4-benzoxazin-3-one, 2-benzoxazolinone and gallic acid from calceolaria thyrsiflora graham and their antibacterial activity</article-title>. <source>Z. Naturforsch. C J. Biosci.</source>\n<volume><bold>60</bold></volume>, <fpage>389</fpage>–<lpage>393</lpage> (<year>2005</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">16042337</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1515/znc-2005-5-604</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"r7\"><label>7</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>W.-H.</given-names>\n<surname>Wu</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>T.-Y.</given-names>\n<surname>Chen</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>R.-W.</given-names>\n<surname>Lu</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>S.-T.</given-names>\n<surname>Chen</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>C.-C.</given-names>\n<surname>Chang</surname></string-name></person-group>, <article-title>Benzoxazinoids from Scoparia dulcis (sweet broomweed) with antiproliferative activity against the DU-145 human prostate cancer cell line</article-title>. <source>Phytochemistry</source>\n<volume><bold>83</bold></volume>, <fpage>110</fpage>–<lpage>115</lpage> (<year>2012</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">22944352</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1016/j.phytochem.2012.07.022</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"r8\"><label>8</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>K.</given-names>\n<surname>Pratt</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>P.</given-names>\n<surname>Kumar</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>W. S.</given-names>\n<surname>Chilton</surname></string-name></person-group>, <article-title>Cyclic hydroxamic acids in dicotyledonous plants</article-title>. <source>Biochem. Syst. Ecol.</source>\n<volume><bold>23</bold></volume>, <fpage>781</fpage>–<lpage>785</lpage> (<year>1995</year>).</mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"r9\"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>M.</given-names>\n<surname>Frey</surname></string-name>\n<etal/></person-group>, <article-title>Analysis of a chemical plant defense mechanism in grasses</article-title>. <source>Science</source>\n<volume><bold>277</bold></volume>, <fpage>696</fpage>–<lpage>699</lpage> (<year>1997</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">9235894</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1126/science.277.5326.696</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"r10\"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>A.</given-names>\n<surname>Gierl</surname></string-name>, <string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>M.</given-names>\n<surname>Frey</surname></string-name></person-group>, <article-title>Evolution of benzoxazinone biosynthesis and indole production in maize</article-title>. <source>Planta</source>\n<volume><bold>213</bold></volume>, <fpage>493</fpage>–<lpage>498</lpage> (<year>2001</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">11556781</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1007/s004250100594</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"r11\"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><string-name name-style=\"western\"><given-names>R.</given-names>\n<surname>Jonczy