cle-title>. <source>Anal. Biochem.</source>\n<volume>112</volume>, \n<fpage>195</fpage>–<lpage>203</lpage> (<year>1981</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">6266278</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1016/0003-2697(81)90281-5</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"R72\"><label>72</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"book\">J. Stockigt, M. H. Zenk, in <italic toggle=\"yes\">Zeitschrift fur Naturforschung. Section C: Biosciences</italic> (Walter de Gruyter, Berlin, 1975), vol. 30, pp. 352–358.<pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1515/znc-1975-5-609</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">126581</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"R73\"><label>73</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Bent</surname><given-names>A. F.</given-names></name></person-group>, \n<article-title>Arabidopsis in planta transformation. Uses, mechanisms, and prospects for transformation of other species</article-title>. <source>Plant Physiol.</source>\n<volume>124</volume>, \n<fpage>1540</fpage>–<lpage>1547</lpage> (<year>2000</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">11115872</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1104/pp.124.4.1540</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC1539310</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"R74\"><label>74</label><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Geisler</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>R. K.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Sainsbury</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Lomonossoff</surname><given-names>G. P.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Rejzek</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Fairhurst</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Olsen</surname><given-names>C.-E.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Motawia</surname><given-names>M. S.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Melton</surname><given-names>R. E.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Hemmings</surname><given-names>A. M.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Bak</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name>, <name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Osbourn</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group>, \n<article-title>Biochemical analysis of a multifunctional cytochrome P450 (CYP51) enzyme required for synthesis of antimicrobial triterpenes in plants</article-title>. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A.</source>\n<volume>110</volume>, \n<fpage>E3360</fpage>–<lpage>E3367</lpage> (<year>2013</year>).<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">23940321</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\" assigning-authority=\"pmc\">10.1073/pnas.1309157110</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC3761579</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article></pmc-articleset>", "source": "PMC:PMC4846459", "error": ""}
