/surname><given-names>E. C.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Buss</surname><given-names>J. H.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Delmar Dos Anjos E Silva</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><etal/></person-group>. (<year>2014</year>). <article-title>Selection of candidate reference genes for real-time PCR studies in lettuce under abiotic stresses</article-title>. <source>Planta</source>\n<volume>239</volume>, <fpage>1187</fpage>–<lpage>1200</lpage>. doi: <pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\">10.1007/s00425-014-2041-2</pub-id>\n<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">24573225</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"B8\"><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\">\n<person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Bouwmeester</surname><given-names>H. J.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Kodde</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Verstappen</surname><given-names>F. W. A.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Altug</surname><given-names>I. G.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>De Kraker</surname><given-names>J.-W.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Wallaart</surname><given-names>T. E.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>2002</year>). <article-title>Isolation and characterization of two germacrene a synthase cDNA clones from chicory</article-title>. <source>Plant Physiol.</source>\n<volume>129</volume>, <fpage>134</fpage>–<lpage>144</lpage>. doi: <pub-id pub-id-type=\"doi\">10.1104/pp.001024</pub-id>\n<pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">12011345</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmcid\">PMC155878</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id=\"B9\"><mixed-citation publication-type=\"journal\">\n<person-group person-group-type=\"author\"><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Cankar</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name name-style=\"western\"><surname>Bundock</surname>